{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"將軍澳昭信路爆鹹水管\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WATER-TKO-261126-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】將軍澳昭信路爆鹹水管。</p><p>鹹水湧出路面，車輛經過要慢駛。</p><p>立法會議員方國珊表示，下午約六時許接獲居民反映昭信路爆鹹水管，鹹水湧出馬路及附近單車徑，有關路段暫時封路，附近交通較為擠塞，她已通知水務署關閉水掣。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:04:07.420951+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:57:32.304547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:57:27.536995+00:00","content_hash":"f0719ca936a1834354580b4b423e5547a51450af86e180f8ee120b370eff4990","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}